      "LANA: What the fucking fuck? I thought you were gonna be like 5 minutes.\nCANDACE: We only been gone like three minutes.\nLANA: 3 MINUTES!! More like 3 fucking years!\nKATE: Yes, you are right. We are stuck een time warp.",
      "BRANDON: I know it. When I was done, I'd spend all that money I made and make a virtual reality room and watch it all over again.\nLANA: Whatever, I think maybe you had enough.\nBRANDON: I ain't had any.",
      "LANA: We’ re going to work.\nKATE: Unlike some assholes."
    ]
